OL,3,GNEWSAConcern population will overwhelm 
OL,4,Anew hospital                           
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised about whether
OL,7,Fa replacement for a hospital, which is 
OL,8,Fseeking approval to be smaller than    
OL,9,Fexpected, will be able to cope with its
OL,10,Flocal population.                      
OL,12,FCounty Durham and Darlington NHS       
OL,13,FFoundation Trust asked to reduce the   
OL,14,Fsize of the new Shotley Bridge Hospital
OL,15,Fin Consett by about 20%, while the     
OL,16,Fexisting hospital has again stopped    
OL,17,Fproviding overnight urgent treatment   
OL,18,Fbecause of staffing pressures.         
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
